  m_text: 'In the end, Pongon and Shibbi arrived to Mt. Fuji.

    Since after being
    defeated Stan Luciferin seemed sad and lonely, they decided to take them with
    them too!


    Terry returned to his peaceful home somewhere in the Polynomerian
    Suburbia.


    Thanks for playing! Press [ESC] to play again!'
